{"event_type":"review","id":"bc151110672bbe83b394e457006bcd415203bbe2c3592ea796162a763b44d226","occurred_at":"2026-11-12T22:54:14Z","payload":{"artifacts":[{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/b2e7b80ba3a6f754bc42ceb1176a0f9a410ab9968f4f7b96e47c8895a202b3fb","sha256":"b2e7b80ba3a6f754bc42ceb1176a0f9a410ab9968f4f7b96e47c8895a202b3fb"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/b945adae1c6ef8a008d36f461e7afc12c97f891a48f31d382b2a59b0122a5cb7","sha256":"b945adae1c6ef8a008d36f461e7afc12c97f891a48f31d382b2a59b0122a5cb7"},{"kind":"git-bundle","location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/c7368eb7b5cfda999831bdb29389ac4c6b4f087e2b512744b8b164c060f6e4aa","sha256":"c7368eb7b5cfda999831bdb29389ac4c6b4f087e2b512744b8b164c060f6e4aa"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/ae173eb4ef86df634bb327410add859bfe16b58854425dc2e9f5c7a76308b2c5","sha256":"ae173eb4ef86df634bb327410add859bfe16b58854425dc2e9f5c7a76308b2c5"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/9edb80d7de981839917d4c3069a391cdddc826db9200665ab84e36be7c9b14fb","sha256":"9edb80d7de981839917d4c3069a391cdddc826db9200665ab84e36be7c9b14fb"}],"attempt_id":"3f7c137f6eaca42024f16df490cbb8805eb7fac656da368646f4d8636b90e4bb:0:1","base":"62c7ddcad517ddfaad10017bc5a2d541fdbbae64","completion":{"errors":[],"exit_code":0,"scope_verified":true,"skipped":false,"terminal":true},"findings":[{"anchor_status":"verified","blob":"3db337f6483619d7773e99385180e473f9899440","body":"**Use the run-owned snapshot for the default session directory.**\n\nWhen no directory option is set, this fallback ignores `config.cqEnv`. If that snapshot sets `CQ_SESSIONS_DIR` to `/run-a`, but the ambient snapshot selects `/run-b`, both lane construction and cleanup target `/run-b`. Transcripts therefore go outside the run's configured store.\n\nForward `config.cqEnv` to `defaultSessionsDir()`. The helper already accepts it at `src/driver/sessions-dir.ts:33-34`.","id":"839decbfed3dfe29db657bc38ec69260c6fa7df7d4c715ce91ec3ba24b198d2d","intervals":[[407,407]],"path":"src/driver/factory.ts","severity":"major","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Use the run-owned snapshot for the default session directory."},{"anchor_status":"verified","blob":"3db337f6483619d7773e99385180e473f9899440","body":"**Mark ACP session-setup failures with `SessionBoundError`.**\n\n`ACP` raises `SessionBoundError` nowhere. The `store.create` call at `src/driver/acp/index.ts:918-922` creates the session. Two awaited calls follow it without a `try` block: `store.appendMessage` at line 925 and `readAcpSessionId` at line 929. A rejection from either one is a plain error. `withReapOnSettle` reaps only a `SessionBoundError` (`src/driver/factory.ts:528`), so the fresh session record and its transcript are left on disk.\n\nWrap the post-creation setup and mark the rejection as owned by the lane:\n\n<details>\n<summary>🐛 Suggested fix</summary>\n\n```diff\n-    await store.appendMessage(record.sessionId, { role: 'user', content: prompt, at: nowIso() });\n+    try {\n+      await store.appendMessage(record.sessionId, { role: 'user', content: prompt, at: nowIso() });\n+    } catch (error) {\n+      throw new SessionBoundError(error, record.sessionId);\n+    }\n```\n\n</details>\n\nApply the same wrapper to the `readAcpSessionId` call at line 929. Import `SessionBoundError` from `../errors.js` alongside the existing error imports.","id":"b69189cca33060e9bcb39b543ff8b152c1fcf918831063ff771501d1efc10aac","intervals":[[528,528]],"path":"src/driver/factory.ts","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Mark ACP session-setup failures with `SessionBoundError`."}],"head":"7d166b00ea403c0020c62b553d7f917d87833268","head_tree":"d25a04086fe6bef0675e193f1532cb0e2684e8b7","input_scope":[{"blob":"3db337f6483619d7773e99385180e473f9899440","intervals":[[8,10],[25,31],[35,36],[42,47],[54,55],[79,80],[87,93],[124,133],[136,141],[146,148],[152,158],[163,164],[169,188],[205,205],[216,222],[228,230],[232,248],[259,371],[374,377],[384,387],[393,408],[419,423],[428,431],[444,444],[446,446],[448,448],[450,456],[488,488],[494,500],[502,503],[508,509],[511,512],[514,515],[517,533],[540,582],[589,592],[614,631],[633,633],[637,641],[643,643]],"path":"src/driver/factory.ts"}],"job_id":"3f7c137f6eaca42024f16df490cbb8805eb7fac656da368646f4d8636b90e4bb:0","outcome":"completed","paths":[{"baseline":{"entry":{"blob":"7b32268be3b2d18f77f5561102f140dc9dee03fd","kind":"blob","mode":"100644","path":"src/driver/factory.ts"},"merge":"6ad492e9bda60974cb02fdaa23834f11c050aa9c","method":"pre-merge","pre":"e9a3e15cca7355682f79a78311ff9158eaaf74fc","source_path":"src/driver/factory.ts"},"blob":"3db337f6483619d7773e99385180e473f9899440","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"src/driver/factory.ts","reason":"bounded verified input"}],"policy_digest":"eacd1bcf42a0e72eca72fcf9c1e9c8f97e7c515cd67a8fa7965c966924647693","repo":"camerontaylor/cq-toolkit","requested_scope":[{"blob":"3db337f6483619d7773e99385180e473f9899440","intervals":[[55,55],[163,164],[236,237],[243,247]],"path":"src/driver/factory.ts"}],"reviewed_scope":[{"blob":"3db337f6483619d7773e99385180e473f9899440","intervals":[[55,55],[163,164],[236,237],[243,247]],"path":"src/driver/factory.ts"}],"scope_digest":"1ce61aa2e55a6f4e1afa7bf07cebaa2bc8a327a13b7194a096136934d93e487b","source":{"authenticated":true,"id":"backfill-3f7c137f6eaca42024f16df490cbb8805eb7fac656da368646f4d8636b90e4bb-g0-20261112T224909Z","producer":"crq-runner-app","repo":"camerontaylor/cq-toolkit","type":"crq-run"},"subject_id":"3f7c137f6eaca42024f16df490cbb8805eb7fac656da368646f4d8636b90e4bb","target":"7bcdbc4e15e50e412d01a8f523c90b9139cf2403","target_tree":"d25a04086fe6bef0675e193f1532cb0e2684e8b7"},"schema":"cq.review-ledger/v1","source_key":"camerontaylor/cq-toolkit:crq-runner-app:backfill-3f7c137f6eaca42024f16df490cbb8805eb7fac656da368646f4d8636b90e4bb-g0-20